/hero__d4bput78wzu6_xlarge.jpg, /in/applecare/images/overview/hero/hero__d4bput78wzu6_xlarge_2x.jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width:0px)\" />\n289: \t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/in/applecare/images/overview/hero/hero__d4bput78wzu6_xlarge.jpg\" onload=\"window.__lp?.(event)\" alt=\"Various Apple products, including a MacBook, an iPhone 18 Pro, an Apple Pencil Pro and an iPad Pro\">\n290: \t\t\t\t</picture>\n291: \t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n292: \t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-copy typography-eyebrow-reduced font-semibold\">AppleCare offers one-stop support and service for all of your Apple products — from the people who know them best. Get easy, fast repairs for accidents like drops and spills. A replacement battery when yours drops below 80% capacity. And priority care with just a&nbsp;chat, call or&nbsp;tap.<sup class=\"footnote footnote-number\"><a href=\"#footnote-1\" aria-label=\"Footnote 1\" data-modal-close>1</a></sup></p>\n293: \t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://coverage.apple.com/os/acacPP1/\" aria-label=\"Get coverage, AppleCare\" class=\" cta button button-elevated\" data-analytics-title='get coverage' data-analytics-exit-link><span class=\"icon-copy\">Get coverage</span></a>\n294: \t\t\t\t</div>\n295: \t\t\t</div>\n296: \t\t</section>\n297: \t\t<section class=\"section section-benefits\" data-anim-scroll-group=\"Benefits\" data-analytics-section-engagement=\"name:benefits\" data-component-list=\"StaggeredFadeIn\">\n298: \t\t\t<div class=\"viewport-content text-center\">\n299: \t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-eyebrow typography-eyebrow\">Benefits</h2>\n300: \t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"section-headline typography-headline-elevated font-bold\">Covered from every angle.</h3>\n301: \t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-copy typography-intro-elevated font-regular\">AppleCare offers peace of mind for all your devices, with coverage inside and out.<sup data-footnote=\"numbered-coverage-begins\" class=\"footnote footnote-number\"><a href=\"#footnote-2\" aria-label=\"Footnote 2\" data-modal-close>2</a></sup><sup>,</sup> <sup data-footnote=\"numbered-service-coverage\" class=\"footnote footnote-number\"><a href=\"#footnote-3\" aria-label=\"Footnote 3\" data-modal-close>3</a></sup></p>\n302: \t\t\t</div>\n303: \t\t\t<div id=\"benefits-gallery\" class=\"gallery gallery-gallery scroll-gallery caption-tile-gallery short\" aria-label=\"Benefits gallery\" data-analytics-gallery-id=\"benefits gallery\" data-component-list=\"CaptionTileGallery\" data-scroll-gallery>\n304: \t\t\t\t<div class=\"scroll-container\">\n305: \t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-container\">\n306: \t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"card-set grid card-set-full-bleed caption-tile-set\" role=\"list\">\n307: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"card-container caption-tile gallery-item\" id=\"benefits-gallery-item-1\" role=\"listitem\" data-ac-gallery-item=\"1\" data-staggered-item data-analytics-gallery-item-id=\"accident coverage\">\n308: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-caption-content typography-caption-tile\">\n309: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"typography-caption-tile-heading card-caption-heading\">Turn to us when accidents happen.</h4>\n310: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Stay protected through life’s ups, downs and even drops. Get quick, Apple-certified repairs —  many issues can be resolved the same day.<sup data-footnote=\"numbered-service-coverage-is-provided\" class=\"footnote footnote-number\"><a href=\"#footnote-4\" aria-label=\"Footnote 4\" data-modal-close>4</a></sup><sup></p>\n311: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n312: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card tile tile-rounded\" data-staggered-item>\n313: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-area-topic-container\">\n314: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-area-topic badge badge-neutral badge-solid-scrim\"></p>\n315: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n316: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-block media-container pin-center\" data-media-type=\"\">\n317: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<picture id=\"overview-benefits-benefits-01-1\" class=\"overview-benefits-benefits-01 positioned-media-element pin-offset static\" dat